{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.Duals","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.Duals","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.Braided","lean:module:QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.BraidingVV","lean:module:QOU.KZ.ZigZag","lean:module:QOU.Mass.BraidedStrands","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Monoidal.Rigid.Basic","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.RigidTensorDual"],"declarations":46,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.rightRigid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.rightRigid","kind":"instance","line":433,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/Drinfeld/Duals.lean#L433-L436","doc":"**`D_ℏ` is right rigid** for every associator `Ψ` and transcendental `ℏ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.pairing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.pairing","kind":"def","line":425,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/Drinfeld/Duals.lean#L425-L431","doc":"The exact pairing `(X, Xᘁ)`, built from `(V, V)` by `tensorExactPairing`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.dualObj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.dualObj","kind":"def","line":419,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/Drinfeld/Duals.lean#L419-L423","doc":"The dual word: `𝟙ᘁ = 𝟙`, `Vᘁ = V`, `(X ⊗ Y)ᘁ = Yᘁ ⊗ Xᘁ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.exactPairingV","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.exactPairingV","kind":"instance","line":403,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/Drinfeld/Duals.lean#L403-L417","doc":"**`V` is self-dual in `D_ℏ`** for every associator and transcendental `ℏ`:\n`η = e₀ ⊗ e₁ − e₁ ⊗ e₀`, `ε' = ν⁻¹ ε`, `ν ≠ 0` by `νΨ_ne_zero`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.νΨ_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.νΨ_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":356,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/Drinfeld/Duals.lean#L356-L393","doc":"**The zigzag scalar is nonzero for every associator `Ψ` and transcendental `ℏ`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.yb_mat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.yb_mat","kind":"theorem","line":345,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/Drinfeld/Duals.lean#L345-L354","doc":"The braid relation on `(V ⊗ V) ⊗ V` in matrix form: `σ₁ = β ⊗ 1`,\n`σ₂ = α⁻¹ (1 ⊗ β) α`, `σ₁σ₂σ₁ = σ₂σ₁σ₂` (`isYB_braiding`, from the hexagons). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.etaL_ne_zero_kron","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.etaL_ne_zero_kron","kind":"theorem","line":332,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/Drinfeld/Duals.lean#L332-L337","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.kron_sub_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.kron_sub_right","kind":"theorem","line":328,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/Drinfeld/Duals.lean#L328-L330","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.βmat_VV_mul_etaL","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.βmat_VV_mul_etaL","kind":"theorem","line":321,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/Drinfeld/Duals.lean#L321-L326","signatureChun