ean:QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.zigΨ_scalar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.zigΨ_scalar","kind":"theorem","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/Drinfeld/Duals.lean#L114-L120","doc":"**The first zigzag is a scalar**: `Φ` commutes with `g^{⊗3}` (class law `commute`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.αinv_VVV","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.αinv_VVV","kind":"theorem","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/Drinfeld/Duals.lean#L97-L110","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.αmat_VVV","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.αmat_VVV","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/Drinfeld/Duals.lean#L87-L95","doc":"The associator on `(V ⊗ V) ⊗ V` is `assocΨ`, relabelled. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.ΦB_fin3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.ΦB_fin3","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/Drinfeld/Duals.lean#L84-L85","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.assocΨ_mul_assocInvΨ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.assocΨ_mul_assocInvΨ","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/Drinfeld/Duals.lean#L81-L82","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.assocInvΨ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.assocInvΨ","kind":"def","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lea